  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "RMC.BestFit 2.0.1 maintenance release of the model library, built against RMC.Numerics 2.2.0. It keeps saved ARIMAX parameters and priors when a model with covariates is restored, copied, or cloned; conditions ARIMAX on max(q, p + b) with covariates; corrects differenced time-series training, reintegration, and transform windows; derives the default time-series training window from its degrees of freedom; keeps Bulletin 17C point estimates when the GMM covariance fails; clears a stale peaks-over-threshold exposure when the input source changes; and now ships its IntelliSense XML documentation. Full notes: https://github.com/USACE-RMC/RMC-BestFit/releases/tag/v2.0.1",
